  "instructions": [
    "Heat olive oil in a large skillet over medium heat. Add the onion and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Add the ginger and garlic and cook for another minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the tomatoes and cook for 2-3 minutes, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the palak paste and cook for another minute, stirring constantly.",
    "Add the spinach and cook until wilted, stirring occasionally.",
    "Add the paneer and cook for 2-3 minutes, until heated through.",
    "Stir in the pickling spices, lime juice, salt, and black pepper.",
    "Cook for an additional minute, until the flavors are well combined.",
    "Serve hot, garnished with cilantro if desired."
